# WSClean smoke-test arguments, one per line. The script appends the MS path
# and output prefix. This tiny 256x256, 1000-iteration imaging pass completes
# in under a minute on one thread.
-size
256
256
-scale
1asec
-niter
1000
-mgain
0.8
-auto-threshold
3
-j
1
# Keep the read-only fixture pristine and skip predicted-model write-back.
-no-update-model-required
